<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Posts on JHY's Blog</title><link>https://imjhy.com/posts/</link><description>Recent content in Posts on JHY's Blog</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>hi@imjhy.com (Hongyu Jiang)</managingEditor><webMaster>hi@imjhy.com (Hongyu Jiang)</webMaster><copyright>© 2026 Hongyu Jiang</copyright><lastBuildDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 18:00:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://imjhy.com/posts/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>个人开发者</title><link>https://imjhy.com/posts/2026-10-29-individual-developer/</link><pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 18:00:00 +0800</pubDate><author>hi@imjhy.com (Hongyu Jiang)</author><guid>https://imjhy.com/posts/2026-10-29-individual-developer/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;下午有点困，打开 B 站看到这个视频。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img&#10; class="my-0 rounded-md"&#10; loading="lazy"&#10; decoding="async"&#10; fetchpriority="auto"&#10; alt="alt text"&#10; width="586"&#10; height="488"&#10; src="https://imjhy.com/posts/2026-10-29-individual-developer/bilibili-screenshot.png"&#10; srcset="https://imjhy.com/posts/2026-10-29-individual-developer/bilibili-screenshot.png 800w, https://imjhy.com/posts/2026-10-29-individual-developer/bilibili-screenshot.png 1280w"&#10; sizes="(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 65vw"&#10; data-zoom-src="https://imjhy.com/posts/2026-10-29-individual-developer/bilibili-screenshot.png"&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;小鸡词典，这个产品已经是很久远的记忆了。近几年断断续续了解过他们的事情，总的来说，感觉个人开发者（或者说没有大腿抱的小团队）很不容易。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>此间乐，不思鼓？</title><link>https://imjhy.com/posts/2026-10-21-nju-suzhou/</link><pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>hi@imjhy.com (Hongyu Jiang)</author><guid>https://imjhy.com/posts/2026-10-21-nju-suzhou/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;高一寒假之前，听一位南计的学长返校宣讲。至今留在我印象里的只有三件事：&lt;/p&gt;</description><media:content xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://imjhy.com/posts/2026-10-21-nju-suzhou/feature_fake-beidalou.jpg"/></item><item><title>NOVA 的「界」</title><link>https://imjhy.com/posts/2026-10-20-nova-boundary/</link><pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>hi@imjhy.com (Hongyu Jiang)</author><guid>https://imjhy.com/posts/2026-10-20-nova-boundary/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;周六论坛上还在跟 cxy 讨论每周一篇文档的事情，却完全没有考虑自己这周有没有写，导致了越界……&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>关于 vibe 小工具和 AI 辅助学习</title><link>https://imjhy.com/posts/2026-10-19-1011-activity-summary/</link><pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 19:10:00 +0800</pubDate><author>hi@imjhy.com (Hongyu Jiang)</author><guid>https://imjhy.com/posts/2026-10-19-1011-activity-summary/</guid><description>&lt;div class="lead text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400 !mb-9 text-xl"&gt;&#10; 对一周前一次社团活动的总结和感想。&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;p&gt;设计活动的时候，其实想交流的是「如何用好&lt;strong&gt;现成的&lt;/strong&gt; AI 工具」，但是三位参与者有两位实际上更多地是在 vibe 新的工具。下面沉淀一下当时输出的内容和感想。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>休息</title><link>https://imjhy.com/posts/2026-09-27-rest/</link><pubDate>Sun, 27 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>hi@imjhy.com (Hongyu Jiang)</author><guid>https://imjhy.com/posts/2026-09-27-rest/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;从鼓楼到仙林，地铁通勤需要将近一个小时。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;头几次去仙林之前，我会想，这两小时我该「干点啥」呢？&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>上海</title><link>https://imjhy.com/posts/2026-09-22-shanghai/</link><pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>hi@imjhy.com (Hongyu Jiang)</author><guid>https://imjhy.com/posts/2026-09-22-shanghai/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;终于有时间回顾七月底的上海之行。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;时隔十年的「故地重游」。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img&#10; class="my-0 rounded-md"&#10; loading="lazy"&#10; decoding="async"&#10; fetchpriority="auto"&#10; alt="出发"&#10; width="1279"&#10; height="1706"&#10; src="https://imjhy.com/posts/2026-09-22-shanghai/departure_hu_9e3fa026c7bf7db.jpg"&#10; srcset="https://imjhy.com/posts/2026-09-22-shanghai/departure_hu_9e3fa026c7bf7db.jpg 800w, https://imjhy.com/posts/2026-09-22-shanghai/departure.jpg 1280w"&#10; sizes="(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 65vw"&#10; data-zoom-src="https://imjhy.com/posts/2026-09-22-shanghai/departure.jpg"&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;出发&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;h2 class="relative group"&gt;第一晚&#10; &lt;div id="第一晚" class="anchor"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;span&#10; class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none"&gt;&#10; &lt;a class="text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline" href="#%e7%ac%ac%e4%b8%80%e6%99%9a" aria-label="锚点"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10; &lt;/span&gt;&#10; &#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;酒店在五角场旁边。晚上七点，办好入住就没事了。想着来了上海好歹去线下体验体验，于是决定外出吃晚饭。&lt;/p&gt;</description><media:content xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://imjhy.com/posts/2026-09-22-shanghai/feature.jpg"/></item></channel></rss>